      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "נחלו \/ מחלק",
      "rationale": "Kɔkanna-nkalansira: נחל kalan ka ɲɛ ni חלק (gila) ye — kasumadenw bɛ u fila ɲagami Bamanankan na."
