    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "u y'u gila",
      "rationale": "Heburukan nɔnabila tɛ yen; kumasen kalan-ɲɛmɔgoya de b'a daminɛ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ninnu ye layidu-teriw ye minnu Elazar sarakalasebaga ye, ani Yehoshua Nun den, ani aw bɛɛ fa-fasow ka matsamɛw, Israyel denkɛw ka mɛnw kɔnɔ, u y'u gila ni gɔrɔtɔ ye Shilo (Silo) la, Yawe ɲɛw fɛ, Ɲɔgɔn-lakɛli da la. O cogo la, u banna ⟨את⟩ dugukolo ɲɛnabɔli la.",
